feat(clv): closing-odds-poller now captures player-prop closes too

Extends the existing edge function (which only handled team
moneyline closes) to also snapshot player-prop closing lines for
the CLV pipeline.

Key changes:
- New PROP_MARKET_KEYS table maps internal stat_type → Odds API
  market key per sport.
- Per-sport request now sends a comma-separated markets= list
  scoped to legs we're actually scanning (cost-aware).
- New leg field closing_line_value (jsonb, no migration) so CLV
  math can detect line moves vs same-line comparisons.
- Bug fix: previous moneyline branch checked "team_moneyline" but
  schema emits "moneyline" — both forms now accepted.

No recommendation logic changes. No schema changes. Per #127 plan.

